[{"title":"题赵仲穆画马 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"紫雾团身白玉蹄，权奇倜傥渥洼姿。\n王孙惯见升平事，貌得当年入贡时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题赵仲穆画马 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"十二天闲总骏才，追风蹑景是龙媒。\n曾随六御临关塞，亲过流沙万里来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子启学士见过仆适他出不遇奉简 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"西城过雨净无泥，杨柳风轻散马蹄。\n虚有琴徽待高会，却惭书札负前题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子启学士见过仆适他出不遇奉简 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"东邻西舍总风流，何处垂杨系紫骝。\n想见斜阳拥归旆，不同雪夜剡溪舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子启见和再用韵奉简时曾新市马 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"雨晴沙净不沾泥，新试娇骢白玉蹄。\n款款金城坊里去，过门凤字不教题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"子启见和再用韵奉简时曾新市马 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"城上西山翠欲流，爱山不骤紫骅骝。\n还如扬子江头看，万叠芙蓉近綵舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"玉署词华照紫泥，逢人不慱铸金蹄。\n绿杨庭馆閒风月，朝退从容每自题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"绿阴池沼擅风流，长系青骡当紫骝。\n自爱官曹清似水，不妨书舍小于舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"不解高阳醉似泥，一壶时共荐豚蹄。\n半酣藻思如泉涌，锦轴华笺取次题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"习礼见和用韵奉酬并简宗琏 其四","author":"杨士奇","text":"雅操俱当第一流，逸材千里见骅骝。\n閒来同坐北窗下，如在清风李郭舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2296,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡祭酒食葵而病戏用奉简兼谢惠蔬 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"雨后畦蔬嘉可观，忽闻憔悴卧幽轩。\n非是安心无妙法，谁教放手刈葵根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2297,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"胡祭酒食葵而病戏用奉简兼谢惠蔬 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"万虑澄清不入怀，饭蔬饮水小茅斋。\n却惭口腹犹贻累，频致园官菜把来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2298,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简胡祭酒 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"重阳醉后又三日，想见黄花绽始多。\n门巷深沈无俗客，高斋清坐养天和。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2299,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简胡祭酒 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"满城冠佩趋朝谒，得似颐庵独自閒。\n心与天光共明净，朝朝爽气对西山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2300,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简胡祭酒 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"朝来邂逅西江客，报道今年盛有秋。\n但得万方同岁稔，吾生贫病不须愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2301,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"唐人醉归图为金学士题","author":"杨士奇","text":"翩翩六骏出腾骧，醉里衣冠见盛唐。\n彷佛开元无事日，不知谁是贺知章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2302,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月廿九日戏简仲熙庶子三绝句时邹徙舍城东 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"萧散双吹碧玉箫，与君同郡复同袍。\n金城坊里清如水，却爱东飞学伯劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2303,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月廿九日戏简仲熙庶子三绝句时邹徙舍城东 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"新岁新斋好著书，文明门里会文儒。\n隔邻春酒蒲萄熟，谁绾青丝送玉壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2304,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月廿九日戏简仲熙庶子三绝句时邹徙舍城东 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"正月已终将二月，城中咫尺见还难。\n金门朝籍皆先送，独遣同寮待长官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2305,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小画寄史志静 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"春含竹树翠淋漓，玉立苍苍太古姿。\n久别仪曹文翰侣，江南蓟北赠相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2306,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题小画寄史志静 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"为有高情共岁寒，别来相忆访平安。\n凭将一片南州意，寄与清曹粉署看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2307,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金幼孚挽诗 其一","author":"杨士奇","text":"独携书史傍林泉，荣利由来意澹然。\n时绕金川看玉笥，未曾轻到县门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2308,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金幼孚挽诗 其二","author":"杨士奇","text":"雪崖风节凛飞霜，蕙带兰袆道味长。\n剩贮诗书遗诸子，乡人共诧白眉郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2309,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金幼孚挽诗 其三","author":"杨士奇","text":"昔岁京华住接邻，论文来往日频频。\n十年不见成终古，洒泪东风为故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":2310,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画寄思贻兄","author":"杨士奇","text":"多情不忍看离群，况复双清共拂云。\n蓟北江南六千里，白头兄弟两乡分。","collection":"明","notice":"","proven